{"id":"625223","name":"葱香肉沫饼","author":"美拉拉的美食日记","authorId":"11567944","desc":"","cover":"images/625223/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"肉沫","amount":"50g"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面加酵母、白糖水、油合好醒发四个小时左右。","img":"images/625223/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"肉沫、葱花加入白胡椒粉、盐、五香粉，加入30ml热油激活香味。","img":"images/625223/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"拌匀备用。","img":"images/625223/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"面团擀成大面皮备用。","img":"images/625223/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"铺好肉馅。","img":"images/625223/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"叠成方块。","img":"images/625223/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"压成饼状。","img":"images/625223/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再次压成饼状后放入电饼档中煎至两面金黄。","img":"images/625223/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"吃前切一切，你闻到了香味吗？","img":"images/625223/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}